      "type": "claim",
      "quote": "Network tariffs contribute to an efficient and secure electricity network.",
      "gist": "Network tariffs help make the electricity network efficient and secure."
    },
    {
      "type": "claim",
      "quote": "In Switzerland, more and more electricity is being produced locally and fed into the electricity distribution network, for example from photovoltaic systems on buildings, while ever more consumers are drawing electricity from the distribution network, such as for electric vehicles and heat pumps.",
      "gist": "Switzerland sees increased local electricity production and consumption, straining the distribution network."
    },
    {
      "type": "claim",
      "quote": "This means that the distribution network is becoming increasingly overloaded.",
      "gist": "The electricity distribution network is becoming overloaded."
    },
    {
      "type": "obligation",
      "quote": "it is not only the expansion of the distribution networks that is needed, but also dynamic network tariffs.",
      "gist": "Expanding distribution networks and implementing dynamic network tariffs are both required."
    }
  ]
}
